@inject IStringLocalizer<Strings> Localizer

@* The hint beside the two year fields of a period (YearPeriod in Data, decided 2026-11-19): an empty year means no limit, and both
   years are included; reversed years are swapped when saved. Only the hint: the year fields must be AppInputNumber directly in the
   form, since the browser only gets the validation rules of inputs placed directly in the form, not inside another component
   (Migration step 3.6). *@

<div class="col-md-@Width form-text">@Localizer["YearPeriodHint"]</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public int Width { get; set; } = 12;
}